    "note": "Pre-change implied mandatory chain is the files AGENTS.md treated as binding by unguarded 'see docs/N' pointers, measured at the exact branch point. memory/LESSONS.md is reported separately because Law 1 required a consult; docs/09 already specified tag-filter rather than full-file ingest."
